@startuml
title ATM Withdrawal Scenario

state "Available Options" as AvailableOptions
state "Custom Value" as CustomValue
state "Transaction Verification" as TransactionVerification
state "Dispense Amount" as DispenseAmount
state "Insufficient Funds" as InsufficientFunds
state "Cancelled Transaction" as CancelledTransaction
state "End Session" as EndSession

AvailableOptions : do / Display available options
CustomValue : do / Get custom value from user

TransactionVerification : entry / Verify transaction with bank server
TransactionVerification : do / Check transaction status
TransactionVerification : exit / Transaction approved or rejected

DispenseAmount : entry / Dispense requested amount
DispenseAmount : do / Dispense cash and return change
DispenseAmount : exit / End session

InsufficientFunds : entry / Inform user of insufficient funds
InsufficientFunds : do / Return card to user
InsufficientFunds : exit / End session

CancelledTransaction : entry / Cancel transaction and return card
CancelledTransaction : do / End session

EndSession : entry / End ATM session
EndSession : do / Log off user
EndSession : exit / [*]

AvailableOptions --> CustomValue : User chooses custom value
CustomValue --> TransactionVerification

TransactionVerification --> DispenseAmount : Transaction approved
TransactionVerification --> InsufficientFunds : Transaction rejected
InsufficientFunds --> CancelledTransaction : User cancels transaction
CancelledTransaction --> EndSession

DispenseAmount --> EndSession : Successful transaction
@enduml
